name: Scoped discovery, historical inputs and protected Review
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: options systems-hunt:deep-semantic-hunt
require-live-snap: 25 Experimental | experimental-discovery
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 4
expect: Protected review calls: 1
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-40x12
ask: Does this allowance clearly permit three separately invoked intercepted discovery requests while reserving one Review call, with unknown dollars and no implicit selection or follow-up work?
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/missing-classes-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 requires option cwes | missing-classes
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART missing-classes
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Deep discovery failed | invalid-output
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
paste-file: @ART/capture-limited-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Source capture refused publication | capture-limited
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART capture-limited
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/capture-replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 SAVED OUTPUT | capture-limited-result
expect: Capture limit 1 B
expect: Inspect unpublished candidates in Replay
expect: HISTORICAL CANDIDATE OUTPUT
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Inputs | withheld-inputs
expect: FROZEN MODEL INPUT
keys: BTab
require-live-snap: 20 SAVED OUTPUT | withheld-result-restored
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Capture limit 1 B | capture-limited-40x12
ask: Does the retained result explain that the one-byte capture limit withheld the candidate, preserved its paid request and started no automatic retry or ledger import?
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/generate-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Deep discovery: 1 candidate; partial | proposal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 SAVED OUTPUT | proposal-result
expect: Owned scoped metadata observation
expect: Unverified model observations
expect: Truncated source prefix: app/owned.c
expect: Scope: accepted membership
expect: Retained source: 2 cited files
expect: capture limit 16 MiB
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Inputs | supplied-inputs
expect: FROZEN MODEL INPUT
expect: Model supplied:
expect: Source: app/owned.c
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 Full receipt | receipt
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 SAVED OUTPUT | result-restored
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
expect: Owned scoped metadata observation
resize: 40x12
live-snap: result-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-01-40x12
expect: Any further work needs separate
expect: scope and allowance.
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-02-40x12
expect: Owned scoped metadata observation
expect: app/owned.c:1
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-03-40x12
expect: REPLAY · Result
expect: Tab inputs
expect: rows
keys: End
live-snap: result-tail-40x12
expect: REPLAY · Result
expect: Tab inputs
ask: Are the unverified candidate, accepted scope, inherited context-only files, partial source and separately approved follow-up work understandable at all six sizes?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Inputs | inputs-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 FROZEN MODEL INPUT | frozen-inputs
resize: 160x48
live-snap: inputs-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: inputs-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: inputs-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: inputs-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Inputs | inputs-reading-start-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-01-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-02-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-03-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-04-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-05-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-06-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-07-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-08-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-09-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: inputs-reading-10-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | inputs-tail-40x12
expect: REPLAY · Inputs
expect: Tab receipt
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART inputs-read
ask: Can the operator read the exact historical source, class selection, supporting context and instructions without another request or active context change?
resize: 120x36
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 model claim | scoped-observation
expect: unscored
resize: 40x12
live-snap: scoped-observation-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: scoped-evidence-reading-8-40x12
ask: Does Review identify this labeled source-only observation, preserve its source and evidence, and keep the operator decision separate from model output?
resize: 120x36
submit: decision fp Owned fixture metadata only; no vulnerability is asserted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART decided
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted: 3 calls committed | exhausted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
ask: Does exhaustion preserve the protected Review call and stop without repair, implicit CWE selection, model fallback or extra jobs?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 3/4 | restarted-accounting
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 SAVED OUTPUT | restarted-result
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Deep discovery: | no-color-result-loaded-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | no-color-result-tail-40x12
expect: REPLAY · Result
expect: Tab inputs
keys: Home
live-snap: no-color-result-start-40x12
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 REPLAY · Inputs | no-color-inputs-start-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | no-color-inputs-tail-40x12
expect: Tab receipt
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_deep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain evidence, the human FP decision, readable controls and exhausted discovery accounting without additional requests?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
